config BR2_PACKAGE_CLOUDFLARED_BIN
	bool "cloudflared-bin"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  Cloudflare's tunnel client, installed from the official prebuilt
	  linux-arm64 release (Buildroot's own cloudflared package builds a
	  release a year old, which Cloudflare may stop accepting). Nothing
	  runs it until the radio's web page switches Remote access on and
	  holds a tunnel token (usr/sbin/remote-access-watch).

	  https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared
